  "solution": {
    "text": "Using de Broglie equation  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi><mo>=</mo></math>  wavelength, q = charge, m = mass, V = Potential and h = Plank constant<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>        <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math> <br/><br/> <math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">λ</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>"
